@AttendanceTrackerAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5162

### Login
POST {{AttendanceTrackerAPI_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Register face (reference selfie)
# NOTE: Use multipart form-data in your client (VS Code REST client / Swagger UI).
# Fields:
# - employeeId (int)
# - selfie (file)

### Office attendance (GPS + selfie)
# NOTE: Use multipart form-data.
# Fields:
# - employeeId (int)
# - latitude (double)
# - longitude (double)
# - attendanceType (string, e.g. "Office")
# - selfie (file)

###
